Package: czd-purple-tokens
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fonts-ibm-plex, fontconfig
Description: CZD Purple design tokens, fonts and build string
 The single source for every colour, size and spacing value in the CZD Purple
 respin, as JSON, shell and CSS, plus the Archivo typeface and the build
 string. Every other czd-* package depends on this one.
